 "title": "Early Access",
 "content": "<section class=\"alp-hero alp-ea-hero\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alp-hero-video\" src=\"https://aminolabspro.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo-banner-alle-pro.webp\" alt=\"aminolabspro Produktreihe\" /></p>\n<div class=\"alp-hero-inner alp-ea-inner\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"alp-hero-kicker\">— EARLY ACCESS</p>\n<h1 class=\"alp-hero-h1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Sei als Erster dabei.<br />\nSichere dir <span class=\"hi\">15% Rabatt.</span></h1>\n<p class=\"alp-ea-sub\">Trag dich jetzt ein und bekomm deinen persönlichen Willkommensrabatt-Code, sobald wir live gehen — einmalig einlösbar, nur für Early-Access-Anmelder.</p>\n<div class=\"alp-ea-form-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f1032-o1\" lang=\"de-DE\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"1032\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/999#wpcf7-f1032-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Kontaktformular\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"1032\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.7\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"de_DE\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f1032-o1\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n</fieldset>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"your-email\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"deine@email.de\" value=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" /></span>\n</p>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"acceptance-privacy\"><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-acceptance\"><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"acceptance-privacy\" value=\"1\" aria-invalid=\"false\" /><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item-label\">Ich bin damit einverstanden, dass meine E-Mail-Adresse gespeichert wird, um mich über den Start von aminolabspro zu informieren.</span></label></span></span></span>\n</p>\n<p><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Jetzt anmelden →\" />\n</p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"alp-ea-note\">Keine Weitergabe deiner Daten. Jederzeit abmeldbar. Kein Spam — nur eine E-Mail, sobald der Shop live ist.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<p><!-- WARUM EARLY ACCESS --></p>\n<section class=\"section section-alt\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"alp-ea-usp-grid\">\n<div class=\"alp-usp-card fade-up\">\n<div class=\"alp-usp-icon alp-ea-icon-percent\"></div>\n<div class=\"alp-usp-title\">15% Willkommensrabatt</div>\n<p class=\"alp-usp-text\">Einmalig einlösbar auf deine erste Bestellung — automatisch per E-Mail, sobald wir starten.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"alp-usp-card fade-up\">\n<div class=\"alp-usp-icon alp-ea-icon-bell\"></div>\n<div class=\"alp-usp-title\">Als Erster informiert</div>\n<p class=\"alp-usp-text\">Du erfährst vor allen anderen, wenn neue Chargen und Produkte verfügbar sind.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"alp-usp-card fade-up\">\n<div class=\"alp-usp-icon alp-ea-icon-shield\"></div>\n<div class=\"alp-usp-title\">Kein Risiko</div>\n<p class=\"alp-usp-text\">Nur deine E-Mail-Adresse — keine Zahlungsdaten, keine Verpflichtung, jederzeit abmeldbar.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<p><!-- ABSCHLUSS-CTA --></p>\n<div class=\"alp-cta alp-ea-cta\">\n<div class=\"alp-cta-inner\">\n<p><span class=\"eyebrow\">Fast geschafft</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
